      "description": "A form of prejudice or discrimination against Muslims, often manifesting as fear, hatred, or stereotyping. The meme implicitly references this by using an image of angry protesters (often associated with extremist or radical Islamic movements) to undermine the peaceful nature of Islam, which is a common tactic in Islamophobic discourse.",
