      "description": "The meme is designed to target non-Muslims, particularly those who may hold or express skepticism about the claim that Islam is a religion of peace. The text explicitly frames disagreement as ignorance, implying that only those who accept the claim are informed, thereby directly addressing and attempting to convert or silence critics. The visual of anger and aggression is used to provoke a reaction from this audience, suggesting that their disagreement is irrational or uninformed.",
